2 receptors producing decreased and increased compliance respectively. There is also increased basal nitric oxide activity producing an increase in compliance when measured as the reduction in compliance to nitric oxide synthase inhibition.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="vhrm-5-073f1"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>